OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 20 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto welcomes South London
OL,12,     Gsinger-songwriter, multi-
OL,13,     Ginstrumentalist and film score
OL,14,     Gcomposer Tawiah as his guest.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GThe St. Gallen Symphony Orchestra
OL,17,     Gperforms Rimsky-Korsakov's
OL,18,     GScheherazade suite, alongside
OL,19,     GDohnanyi's Symphonic Minutes and
OL,20,     GGyula David's Viola Concerto with
OL,21,     Gsoloist Dana Zemtsov.
